abstract: >-
  An open application note on 120/240 V four-wire delta services (closed
  high-leg delta and open delta): theory, NEC 2023 requirements, the 208 V
  question, common field problems, and worked commercial and industrial
  examples, with a macro-free workbook, an interactive explorer and OpenDSS
  validation models.
